            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cherry Liu"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious, but way too concentrated. I added 3.5 cups of San Pelligrino to a 6 serving recipe...sparkling mint julep is so much better! I also didn't strain the mint leaves because I thought they were so pretty :)",
            "datePublished": "2019-07-12T00:52:35.217Z"
