            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this recipe last year on Kentucky Derby Day &amp; will again today. Tasty, refreshing &amp; great way to use surplus mint that from the garden. My husband suggested replacing the H2O &amp; sugar w/ginger ale which I may do, but not on the day of the derby! Suggestion: double the recipe, everyone will want a refill.",
